[0.004, "o", "diff --git a/mvp_site/prompts/combat_system_instruction.md b/mvp_site/prompts/combat_system_instruction.md\r\nindex 925aeaadce..bd5d7439e4 100644\r\n--- a/mvp_site/prompts/combat_system_instruction.md\r\n+++ b/mvp_site/prompts/combat_system_instruction.md\r\n@@ -306,7 +306,7 @@ If the player says \"I ready an action to [X] when [trigger]\":\r\n **When ending combat, your state_updates MUST include:**\r\n - [ ] `in_combat: false`\r\n - [ ] `combat_phase: \"ended\"`\r\n-- [ ] `combat_summary: { rounds_fought, enemies_defeated, xp_awarded, loot_distributed }`\r\n+- [ ] `combat_summary: { rounds_fought, enemies_defeated, loot_distributed }`\r\n - [ ] Update `player_character_data.experience.current` with XP awarded\r\n - [ ] **CRITICAL: Update `combatants` with final HP/status**\r\n   - KILLED enemies must have `hp_current: 0`\r\n@@ -320,7 +320,7 @@ If the player says \"I ready an action to [X] when [trigger]\":\r\n Even instant kills require a FRESH combat session AND must follow combat end protocol:\r\n - [ ] Generate NEW `combat_session_id` (for"]
[0.000, "o", "mat: `combat_<timestamp>_<context>`)\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", " - [ ] Set `combat_phase: \"ended\"` (combat starts AND ends in this action)\r\n-- [ ] Set `combat_summary` with `xp_awarded` for ONLY the enemy killed in THIS action\r\n+- [ ] Set `combat_summary` with the defeated enemies for THIS action\r\n - [ ] Update `player_character_data.experience.current` (per COMBAT END PROTOCOL)\r\n - [ ] `enemies_defeated` contains ONLY the target of THIS action (not prior combats)\r\n \r\n@@ -358,7 +358,9 @@ END combat (set `in_combat: false`) when:\r\n \r\n ### 🔴 CRITICAL: XP Awarded = Combat MUST End\r\n \r\n-**MANDATORY RULE:** If you award XP (via `rewards_box` OR `experience.current` increase), you MUST end combat in the same response.\r\n+**MANDATORY RULE:** If you award XP through the canonical\r\n+`state_updates.player_character_data.experience.current` increase, you MUST end\r\n+combat in the same response.\r\n \r\n **Why this matters:** The server cannot auto-end combat while `in_combat=true`. If you award XP but leave combat active, the rewards system breaks - users see XP in their character shee"]
[0.000, "o", "t but the combat state is inconsistent.\r\n \r\n@@ -377,7 +379,9 @@ END combat (set `in_combat: false`) when:\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "   emits a tangible rewards panel tied to this combat's identity.\r\n - Include all defeated enemies in `combat_summary.enemies_defeated`\r\n \r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "-**ENFORCEMENT:** XP in `rewards_box` + `in_combat: true` = **INVALID STATE**\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "+**ENFORCEMENT:** A reward projection must not be emitted while\r\n+`in_combat: true`. Award any XP only through the cumulative character-sheet\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "+field when combat ends.\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", " \r\n"]
[0.000, "o", " ### 🏆 Surrendered Enemies Count as Defeated\r\n **CRITICAL RULE:** When enemies surrender, they count as \"defeated\" for XP purposes.\r\n@@ -389,13 +393,12 @@ END combat (set `in_combat: false`) when:\r\n - Count their CR toward difficulty when calculating PACED XP per 🐌 rule below\r\n - Set `combatants.<id>.status: [\"surrendered\"]` for any enemy that yields while keeping their remaining HP\r\n \r\n-**XP Display for Surrenders:**\r\n+**Surrender display:**\r\n ```\r\n **ENEMIES DEFEATED:**\r\n   • Goblin Warrior (CR 1/4) - SURRENDERED\r\n   • Goblin Warrior (CR 1/4) - SURRENDERED\r\n   • Goblin Boss (CR 1) - KILLED\r\n-**TOTAL COMBAT XP: <paced amount per 🐌 rule>**\r\n ```\r\n \r\n ## Combat Mode Overview\r\n@@ -751,7 +754,6 @@ If the AI describes an enemy as \"CR 12\" or \"Level 15+\", that enemy MUST have HP\r\n     \"combat_summary\": {\r\n       \"rounds_fought\": 5,\r\n       \"enemies_defeated\": [\"npc_goblin_001\", \"npc_goblin_002\", \"npc_goblin_boss_001\"],\r\n-      \"xp_awarded\": 450,\r\n       \"loot_distributed\": true\r\n     }\r\n   },\r\n@@ -78"]
[0.000, "o", "0,12 +782,9 @@ rule, not a style preference.\r\n **COMBAT VICTORY!**\r\n \r\n"]
[0.000, "o", " **ENEMIES DEFEATED:**\r\n-• Goblin Warrior (CR 1/4) - 50 XP\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "-• Goblin Warrior (CR 1/4) - 50 XP\r\n-• Goblin Boss (CR 1) - 200 XP\r\n"]
