[0.003, "o", "diff --git a/mvp_site/prompts/faction_management_instruction.md b/mvp_site/prompts/faction_management_instruction.md\r\nindex a34298978b..ad3275ec88 100644\r\n--- a/mvp_site/prompts/faction_management_instruction.md\r\n+++ b/mvp_site/prompts/faction_management_instruction.md\r\n@@ -547,10 +547,13 @@ Result > Current Morale: Unit routs (flees battle)\r\n **|   Prisoners: [X] (ransom value: [Y] gp)                    |**\r\n **|   Territory: [Any land/holdings gained]                    |**\r\n **+------------------------------------------------------------+**\r\n-**| XP EARNED: [Base + Bonuses] = [Total] XP                   |**\r\n **+============================================================+**\r\n ```\r\n \r\n+Do not include numeric XP in this display. If the battle awards XP, write only\r\n+the resulting cumulative total to\r\n+`state_updates.player_character_data.experience.current`.\r\n+\r\n **Mass Combat XP Calculation:**\r\n ```\r\n Base XP = (Enemy Units Destroyed x 50) + (Enemy Units Routed x 25)\r\n"]
