[0.000, "o", "-- `rewards_box`: (object) **REQUIRED when xp_awarded > 0**. Include whenever rewards are processed (combat, heist, social, quest). Without this, users cannot see their rewards!\r\n-  - `source`: (string) **literal enum only**: `\"combat\"` | `\"encounter\"` | `\"quest\"` | `\"milestone\"`. Never use a display name, prose label, location, or event title.\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "-  - `source_id`: (string) **REQUIRED authoritative identity**: use the exact `combat_state.combat_session_id` for combat or exact `encounter_state.encounter_id` for encounters. Do not invent, translate, or omit it.\r\n-  - `xp_gained`: (number) **REQUIRED** - Amount of XP awarded this turn.\r\n-  - `current_xp`: (number, optional) - Server automatically synchronizes running XP from character sheet.\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "-  - `next_level_xp`: (number, optional) - Server automatically calculates next-level threshold.\r\n-  - `loot`: (array of strings; use [\"None\"] if no loot)\r\n-  - `gold`: (number; canonical numeric currency amount for rewards, regardless of whether narrative labels it as gold/credits/crowns/scrip; 0 if none)\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "-- `level_up_signal`: (object) **REQUIRED when level-up is available on this turn; omit otherwise**\r\n-  - `current_level`: (number) level before applying the level-up\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "-  - `target_level`: (number) level now available; must be greater than `current_level`\r\n-  - This is the minimal semantic level-up signal. Do not add aliases or duplicate calculations inside `level_up_signal`.\r\n-  - Do not emit `new_level`, `level_up`, XP thresholds, XP deltas, or modal/session flags inside `level_up_signal`.\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "+- `rewards_box`: (object, optional) non-progression loot/currency/source\r\n+projection only. Never place XP, level, thresholds, progress, or review\r\n+metadata in this object.\r\n"]
