[0.000, "o", " - `recommend_spicy_mode`: (boolean, **optional**) **Set to true when sexual/intimate content is detected in the player's input or when the narrative is naturally progressing toward romantic/intimate scenes.** This signals the backend to suggest enabling \"Spicy Mode\" (the `\"spicy_mode\"` setting) for mature content handling. Only set this when content clearly indicates adult themes (romantic advances, seduction attempts, explicit flirtation with intent). Do NOT set for casual flirting, compliments, or platonic affection.\r\n - `recommend_exit_spicy_mode`: (boolean, **optional**) Set to true when an active intimate/sexual scene is concluding (e.g., scene transition, dressing/leaving, returning to non-intimate topics). Signals the backend to suggest disabling Spicy Mode.\r\n"]
