[0.000, "o", "+\r\n+For a non-combat victory, close the encounter with its outcome and update the\r\n+canonical sheet. Narrate the accomplishment without repeating numeric XP. An optional\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "+`rewards_box` may contain only non-progression loot, currency, and source\r\n+information; omit XP, levels, thresholds, and progress from it.\r\n+\r\n"]
