[0.000, "o", "mbat\",\r\n-    \"source_id\": \"<exact combat_state.combat_session_id or encounter_state.encounter_id>\",\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "-    \"xp_gained\": 50,\r\n-    \"current_xp\": 300,\r\n-    \"next_level_xp\": 300,\r\n-    \"loot\": [\"Rusty Dagger\"],\r\n-    \"gold\": 10\r\n-  }\r\n-}\r\n-```\r\n-\r\n-**When level-up is available** (crossing detected this turn), apply the sheet immediately and emit `level_up_signal` as described above.\r\n-```json\r\n-{\r\n-  \"rewards_box\": {\r\n-    \"source\": \"combat\",\r\n-    \"source_id\": \"<exact combat_state.combat_session_id or encounter_state.encounter_id>\",\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "-    \"xp_gained\": 102,\r\n-    \"current_xp\": 306,\r\n-    \"next_level_xp\": 300,\r\n-    \"loot\": [],\r\n"]
