[0.000, "o", "  \\\"Test Character (Lvl 1)\\\",\\n        \\\"Sparring Construct (Lvl 1)\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"text\\\": \\\"Morning (08:00:00) in the Divine Training Gauntlet - Entrance\\\\u2014The heavy bronze doors groan as they seal behind you, leaving you in a vast, vaulted chamber of white marble and gold filigree. Test Character (Lvl 1), your heavy chain mail clinks with every step as you grip your shield, the weight of your noble lineage and your new oath resting heavy on your shoulders. Ahead, the chamber opens into a series of sparring circles where the first of the divine constructs hums with soft, celestial light, its marble limbs shifting in a slow, rhythmic pattern. The scent of ozone and ancient incense fills the air, signaling the start of your first trial.\\\",\\n      \\\"faction_header\\\": \\\"\\\",\\n      \\\"dice_rolls\\\": [],\\n      \\\"user_scene_number\\\": 9,\\n      \\\"location_confirmed\\\": \\\"Divine Training Gauntlet - Entrance\\\",\\n      \\\"sequence_id\\\": 18,\\n      \\\"part\\\": 1,\\n      \\\"actor\\\": \\\"gemini\\\",\\n      \\\"system_warnin"]
[0.000, "o", "gs\\\": [\\n        \\\"Missing action_resolution field (required for player actions)\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"timestamp\\\": \\\"2026-08-27T21:51:23.882106+00:00\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"part\\\": 1,\\n      \\\"text\\\": \\\"on each ordinary story turn where time advances, give me 34% of exp to the next level for every successful or failed dice roll. Do not do it during god mode or turns where. time doesn't advance. If level 2 is at 300 xp and level 3 is what we're moving toward and is 900 exp it hsould be 0.34 * (900-300) = 204\\\",\\n      \\\"mode\\\": \\\"god\\\",\\n      \\\"actor\\\": \\\"user\\\",\\n      \\\"timestamp\\\": \\\"2026-08-27T21:51:43.961560+00:00\\\",\\n      \\\"sequence_id\\\": 19,\\n      \\\"user_scene_number\\\": null\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"god_mode_response\\\": \\\"Directive accepted. I have established a custom XP progression rule: For every dice roll made in Story Mode (success or failure) during turns where time advances, you will receive 34% of the XP required to reach your next level. \\\\n\\\\nAt Level 1, this equates to 102 XP per roll (3"]
[0.000, "o", "4% of the 300 XP threshold). This rule is now part of the active campaign instructions and will be applied during narrative resolution. God Mode and frozen-time turns (Think blocks) are excluded from this bonus.\\\",\\n      \\\"state_updates\\\": {\\n        \\\"player_character_data\\\": {\\n          \\\"armor_class\\\": 18,\\n          \\\"resource_registry\\\": {},\\n          \\\"attributes\\\": {\\n            \\\"strength\\\": 16,\\n            \\\"constitution\\\": 15,\\n            \\\"wisdom\\\": 13,\\n            \\\"charisma\\\": 14,\\n            \\\"intelligence\\\": 9,\\n            \\\"dexterity\\\": 11\\n          },\\n          \\\"hp_max\\\": 12,\\n          \\\"entity_id\\\": \\\"pc_test_character_001\\\",\\n          \\\"class_name\\\": \\\"Paladin\\\",\\n          \\\"display_name\\\": \\\"Test Character\\\",\\n          \\\"level\\\": 1,\\n          \\\"race\\\": \\\"Human\\\",\\n          \\\"equipment\\\": {\\n            \\\"shield\\\": \\\"Shield\\\",\\n            \\\"main_hand\\\": \\\"Longsword\\\",\\n            \\\"armor\\\": \\\"Chain Mail\\\"\\n          },\\n          \\\"base_attributes\\\": {\\n            \\\"str"]
