[0.000, "o", " upon the cold, pristine marble, her hands clasped over the cross-guard of her longsword as she seeks to anchor her spirit to her newly sworn Oath of Devotion. The air here is thinner, vibrating with a higher frequency of celestial energy that hums through the soles of her boots. She reaches for the divine thread of 'Sanctuary,' attempting to weave the gauntlet's power into her defensive aura, but her focus wavers. The memory of the first construct's core shattering\\\\u2014the raw, violent success of it\\\\u2014pulses in her mind, creating a static that disrupts the required serenity. The meditation provides the mechanical preparation of her spells, yet the deep spiritual resonance she sought remains just out of reach, leaving her feeling spiritually bruised despite her physical ascension. As she rises, the far wall of the chamber shimmers, revealing three floating conduits of crystalline energy that orbit a central pedestal, waiting for the touch of a consecrated hand.\\\",\\n      \\\"faction_header\\\": \\\"\\\",\\n     "]
