[0.000, "o", " in the Second Chamber of the Divine Training Gauntlet\\\\u2014Central Pedestal. Test Character (Lvl 3), you rise from your kneeling position, the clatter of your chain mail echoing against the high, shimmering walls. The feeling of spiritual dissonance from your meditation lingers like a faint static, but you push through it, drawing upon the inherent authority of your noble blood and the newly forged resolve of your Oath. You approach the central pedestal, where the air hums with the concentration of raw celestial energy. \\\\n\\\\nOne gauntleted hand reaches out, fingers brushing the cool, pulsing surface of the white marble. \\\\\\\"By the mandate of the High Heavens and the blood of House Ashwood, I command this trial to advance,\\\\\\\" you declare, your voice resonant and steady. The gauntlet's energy surges in response to your command; the three floating crystalline conduits above the pedestal snap into a rigid triangular formation, their pale blue light turning to a brilliant, blinding white. From the shimmering m"]
