[0.000, "o", "    \\\"status\\\": \\\"RESISTING\\\",\\n        \\\"social_hp_damage\\\": 0,\\n        \\\"successes_needed\\\": 5,\\n        \\\"social_hp\\\": 8,\\n        \\\"roll_result\\\": 0,\\n        \\\"request_severity\\\": \\\"information\\\",\\n        \\\"resistance_shown\\\": \\\"The ancient presence waits for your spirit to fully align with the tenets.\\\",\\n        \\\"npc_id\\\": \\\"\\\",\\n        \\\"roll_dc\\\": 0,\\n        \\\"npc_tier\\\": \\\"ancient\\\",\\n        \\\"objective\\\": \\\"Deepen Divine Understanding\\\",\\n        \\\"skill_used\\\": \\\"Insight\\\",\\n        \\\"social_hp_max\\\": 10\\n      },\\n      \\\"entities_mentioned\\\": [],\\n      \\\"text\\\": \\\"Morning (08:31:06:000002) in the Second Chamber of the Divine Training Gauntlet\\\\u2014In the crystalline silence of your inner contemplation, the sigil of your Sacred Oath manifests as a burning sunburst of pure white light. The ancient voice of the Gauntlet's Echo deepens, carrying the weight of centuries. 'The Oath of Devotion is the shield of the weak and the fire of the righteous, Test Character (Lvl 3). It demands Honesty, "]
[0.000, "o", "Courage, Compassion, Honor, and Duty. By this vow, your flesh is purified\\\\u2014the **Divine Health** of the heavens now flows through your veins, rendering you immune to the blights of disease.'\\\\n\\\\nYou see your longsword, suspended in the golden freeze, begin to thrum with a spectral luminosity. 'Through your Channel Divinity, you may invoke the **Sacred Weapon**. For one minute, your focus shall be absolute, adding the force of your presence\\\\u2014your Charisma (+2)\\\\u2014to every strike you deliver, and illuminating the darkness with the light of your conviction. Or, should you face the desecrated dead or the foul fiends of the Outer Planes, you may **Turn the Unholy**, shattering their resolve with a display of holy radiance.' The vision of the shadowed crown flickers once more in the distance, a dark contrast to the brilliance of your oath, suggesting that your devotion will soon be tested by more than mere constructs.\\\",\\n      \\\"faction_header\\\": \\\"\\\",\\n      \\\"user_scene_number\\\": 25,\\n      \\\"locat"]
