[0.000, "o", "    },\\n      \\\"text\\\": \\\"Morning (08:32:06) in the Second Chamber of the Divine Training Gauntlet\\\\u2014The radiant hum of your longsword intensifies as you drive your advantage home. Test Character (Lvl 3), your Sacred Weapon carves a searing arc through the ozone-thick air, the blade connecting with the Sparring Construct Beta's crystalline shoulder. There is a sharp, crystalline crack as your steel bites deep, shrugging off the construct's sparking defenses. The impact releases a surge of divine feedback that pulses through your armor, a warmth that feels like a physical reinforcement of your soul. You feel your stamina expand and your connection to the gauntlet's energy deepen; the transition to the fourth echelon of your training begins even as you pull your blade back for the next strike. The Construct Beta (Lvl 3) stutters, its lightning-etched staff wavering as it attempts to compensate for the significant breach in its chassis.\\\\n\\\\nSparring Construct Beta (Lvl 3): 36 \\\\u2192 31\\\",\\n      \\\"faction_"]
