[0.000, "o", "current >= goal > 0`. If ANY field of the choice \\u2014 `text`, `description`, `pros`, `cons`, `synergy_bonus`, `thinking`, `id`, or any other field \\u2014 uses acquisition / completion / finish language for a resource already at goal (e.g. \\\"seize the final Anchor\\\", \\\"Completes the Anchor Trilogy\\\", \\\"Acquire the relic\\\"), DROP or rewrite the choice. State-agnostic \\u2014 key off the shape, not the field name. (The `\\\"fully integrat ed\\\"` token is the literal value stored in production Firestore for completed ritual milestones; the trailing space and missing final letter are part of the data, not a typo in this rule. `\\\"fully_integrated\\\"` is the normalized spelling \\u2014 accept both.)\\n   - **Unrevealed Future Events:** before generating the narrative, choices, or thinking, scan the canonical `custom_campaign_state` (or top-level `world_events` / `time_events` / `time_sensitive_events`) for:\\n       - any `world_events.background_events[]` entry where `revealed_at` is absent or null (not yet revealed to t"]
