[0.000, "o", "llenge\\\": {},\\n      \\\"entities_mentioned\\\": [],\\n      \\\"text\\\": \\\"Morning (08:31:06:000001) in the Second Chamber of the Divine Training Gauntlet\\\\u2014the clash of steel and the sizzle of divine lightning fade into a distant murmur as the world around you freezes in a corona of gold. The Sparring Construct Beta (Lvl 3) is caught mid-recoil, the radiant energy of your strike still arcing across its crystalline frame. You find yourself once more in the space between heartbeats, the divine presence of the Gauntlet's Echo vibrating through your soul. The vision of the shadowed crown you glimpsed within the construct's core pulses with a quiet, regal weight, as if your very blood is calling out to it. 'The path of the Sovereign is built upon the stones of your choices, Test Character,' the Echo resonates. 'Refine the vessel of your power, for the trials yet to come demand a soul as unyielding as the oath you have sworn.'\\\",\\n      \\\"faction_header\\\": \\\"\\\",\\n      \\\"user_scene_number\\\": 24,\\n      \\\"location_con"]
