[0.000, "o", "  \\\"text\\\": \\\"The gold-flecked mist of your divine communion coalesces into a singular, piercing point of light before shattering like glass, pulling you back into the physical reality of the Second Chamber. The crystalline silence is replaced by the sharp ozone tang of the gauntlet and the rhythmic, aggressive thrumming of the Sparring Construct Beta. Test Character (Lvl 3), you stand tall, your heavy longsword pulsing with a radiant hum that resonates with the beating of your heart. The weight of your new status\\\\u2014the Divine Health shielding your blood and the sacred tenets of Devotion anchoring your spirit\\\\u2014feels like a physical suit of armor beneath your chain mail. The Sparring Construct Beta (Lvl 3) recalibrates, its twin-ended staff sparking with blue lightning as it senses the solidified presence of a consecrated soul. The gauntlet's energy responds to your unwavering oath, the very marble beneath your feet vibrating in harmony with your cause. The trial is no longer just a test of reflex; it"]
