[0.000, "o", "he Divine Training Gauntlet\\\\u2014Test Character (Lvl 4), the golden radiance of your Sacred Weapon flares as you surge forward once again. Your longsword, imbued with the weight of your Lvl 4 ascension and the pure conviction of your oath, finds its mark with unerring precision. You drive the blade into the junction of the Sparring Construct Beta's crystalline leg and gold-filigreed torso. The impact vibrates through your reinforced gauntlets, and you feel the construct\\\\u2019s internal mechanisms stutter as a surge of radiant energy disrupts its power flow. Golden cracks spiderweb across its form, shedding shards of inert crystal onto the marble floor. The sentinel attempts to retaliate with a sweeping blow of its lightning-staff, but your movements are swifter, more fluid\\\\u2014as if the gauntlet itself is yielding to your authority. The vision of the shadowed crown pulses in your mind, anchoring your focus as you prepare to dismantle this divine sentinel completely.\\\\n\\\\nSparring Construct Beta (Lvl 3): 3"]
