[0.000, "o", " fingers brushing the cool, pulsing surface of the white marble. \\\\\\\"By the mandate of the High Heavens and the blood of House Ashwood, I command this trial to advance,\\\\\\\" you declare, your voice resonant and steady. The gauntlet's energy surges in response to your command; the three floating crystalline conduits above the pedestal snap into a rigid triangular formation, their pale blue light turning to a brilliant, blinding white. From the shimmering mist at the edge of the chamber, a new figure begins to manifest\\\\u2014the Sparring Construct Beta (Lvl 3). It is taller than the first, its form composed of translucent crystal and gold-etched marble, wielding a twin-ended staff that crackles with divine lightning. You feel the final remnants of your transition to the third echelon of training settle into your soul\\\\u2014your body is now a temple of Divine Health, and the weight of your Sacred Oath of Devotion provides a clarity of purpose that burns brighter than the construct's glow.\\\",\\n      \\\"faction_head"]
