[0.000, "o", "around you shimmers with an intense, expectant heat as the trial begins. The Sparring Construct Beta (Lvl 3) manifests with a blinding surge of white light, its crystalline frame refracting the chamber's glow into a kaleidoscope of lethal intent. It moves with a sudden, jerky speed that belies its mechanical nature, spinning its twin-ended staff with a sound like a localized thunderstorm.\\\\n\\\\nThe construct strikes first, its staff whistling through the air as it lunges at you. You raise your shield just in time; the lightning-charged head of the weapon slams into the heavy steel with a bone-jarring impact, sending a spray of blue sparks across your vision, but your defensive stance holds firm. Drawing upon the wellspring of your newfound Oath, you channel the gauntlet's raw energy into your own weapon. \\\\\\\"By the light of my oath!\\\\\\\" you cry. Your longsword erupts into a brilliant, steady radiance that pushes back the shadows of the chamber, the blade humming with the divine authority of a Sacred Weapon. Yo"]
