[0.000, "o", "ll, \\\"total\\\": damage_total, \\\"label\\\": \\\"Longsword Damage\\\", \\\"success\\\": True}\\n        if success else None\\n    )\\n}))\\n```\\n\\n### \\ud83d\\udea8 Damage Rule (Critical)\\n- If the attack misses, DO NOT roll damage dice. No RNG calls for damage on a miss.\\n- **NEVER emit a placeholder/zero damage entry.** \\\"No damage\\\" means OMIT the damage roll entirely (`\\\"damage\\\": null`), not `{\\\"notation\\\": \\\"1d6+2\\\", \\\"rolls\\\": [0], \\\"result\\\": 0, \\\"total\\\": 0}`. A die face of 0 is physically impossible and will be rejected.\\n\\n### \\ud83d\\udea8 Face-Range Invariant (Absolute)\\n- Every die face MUST be in `1..N` for a `dN`. A `1d6` produces a face in `1..6`; a `1d20` in `1..20`. **A face of `0` (or any value outside `1..N`) is impossible and will be dropped from the record.**\\n- Always call `random.randint(1, N)` \\u2014 the lower bound is `1`, NEVER `0`. `random.randint(0, 6)` is WRONG (it can return 0); use `random.randint(1, 6)`.\\n- `rolls[]` holds raw faces only. A 0 in `rolls[]` is never a valid roll; if you have not"]
