[0.000, "o", "lude the damage roll entry in `mechanics.rolls` when an attack hits. The only exception is a miss (no damage roll needed).\\n\\n4. **Damage only on hits**: If the attack misses, do not execute damage dice and do not add damage-related mechanics entries.\\n\\n5. **State updates are immediate**: Update `combatants` in `state_updates` immediately after each hit \\u2014 do NOT batch to end-of-round.\\n\\n**Skill Check (DC + dc_reasoning REQUIRED):**\\n```python\\nimport json, random, time\\nrandom.seed(time.time_ns())\\n# \\u26a0\\ufe0f Set DC and reasoning BEFORE rolling - proves fairness\\ndc = 15\\ndc_reasoning = \\\"guard is alert but area is noisy\\\"  # WHY this DC\\nroll = random.randint(1, 20)  # Roll AFTER DC is set\\nmodifier = 3\\ntotal = roll + modifier\\nsuccess = False if roll == 1 else True if roll == 20 else total >= dc\\nprint(json.dumps({\\\"notation\\\": \\\"1d20+3\\\", \\\"rolls\\\": [roll], \\\"modifier\\\": modifier, \\\"result\\\": roll, \\\"total\\\": total, \\\"label\\\": \\\"Stealth\\\", \\\"dc\\\": dc, \\\"dc_reasoning\\\": dc_reasoning, \\\"success\\\""]
[0.000, "o", ": success}))\\n```\\n\\n**Saving Throw (DC + dc_reasoning REQUIRED):**\\n```python\\nimport json, random, time\\nrandom.seed(time.time_ns())\\n# \\u26a0\\ufe0f Set DC and reasoning BEFORE rolling - proves fairness\\ndc = 15\\ndc_reasoning = \\\"Dragon breath weapon (CR 10, standard DC 15)\\\"  # WHY this DC\\nroll = random.randint(1, 20)  # Roll AFTER DC is set\\nmodifier = 4\\ntotal = roll + modifier\\nsuccess = False if roll == 1 else True if roll == 20 else total >= dc\\nprint(json.dumps({\\\"notation\\\": \\\"1d20+4\\\", \\\"rolls\\\": [roll], \\\"modifier\\\": modifier, \\\"result\\\": roll, \\\"total\\\": total, \\\"label\\\": \\\"CON Save\\\", \\\"dc\\\": dc, \\\"dc_reasoning\\\": dc_reasoning, \\\"success\\\": success}))\\n```\\n\\n### \\u26a0\\ufe0f DC Reasoning is MANDATORY for Skill Checks and Saving Throws\\nThe `dc_reasoning` field proves you set the DC BEFORE seeing the roll result.\\nThis prevents 'just in time' DC manipulation to fit narratives.\\n\\n**Advantage/Disadvantage:** The code_execution path rolls 2d20 (one kept, one dropped). Roll BOTH raw d20 values via"]
