[0.000, "o", "\\\", \\\"text\\\": \\\"Select Feat: Heavy Armor Master\\\", \\\"description\\\": \\\"You can use your armor to deflect strikes. Increase STR by 1 and reduce non-magical physical damage taken by 3.\\\", \\\"risk_level\\\": \\\"safe\\\", \\\"pros\\\": [\\\"Passive damage reduction\\\", \\\"Nudges STR to 17\\\"], \\\"cons\\\": [\\\"Less effective against magical damage\\\", \\\"Incremental rather than transformative\\\"], \\\"confidence\\\": \\\"medium\\\", \\\"freeze_time\\\": true}]\\n\"}}, {\"text\": \"{\\n  \\\"narrative\"}, {\"text\": \"\\\": \\\"Morning (08:32:06:000003) in the Second Chamber\"}, {\"text\": \" of the Divine Training Gauntlet—Test Character (Lvl 4), the golden stasis of your divine communion deepens as the physical\"}, {\"text\": \" world remains suspended. The crystalline shards of the Sparring Construct Beta hang motionless in the air, glowing with the resonant frequency\"}, {\"text\": \" of your recent strike. The Gauntlet's Echo (Lvl 20) manifest as a shimmering pillar of light before\"}, {\"text\": \" you, its voice vibrating not in your ears, but directly within your soul. "]
[0.000, "o", "'The fourth echelon is a threshold of definition\"}, {\"text\": \", Test Character,' the Echo resonates. 'It is where the raw strength of your blood meets the refined edge of your purpose. Will\"}, {\"text\": \" you harden your frame for the battles ahead, or will you sharpen the spiritual focus that fuels your light?' The vision of the shadowed crown you glimpsed within\"}, {\"text\": \" the construct's core remains persistent in your mind's eye—a heavy, dark weight that seems to challenge the\"}, {\"text\": \" very radiance of the chamber, urging you to choose with absolute clarity.\\\\n\\\\n[SOCIAL SKILL CHALLENGE: The Gauntlet'\"}, {\"text\": \"s Echo]\\\\nObjective: Complete Level 4 Evolution\\\\nSocial HP: 8/10 | Status:\"}, {\"text\": \" RESISTING\\\",\\n  \\\"planning_block\\\": {\\n    \\\"thinking\\\": \\\"Test Character has reached the Level 4 milestone\"}, {\"text\": \", granting her an Ability Score Improvement (ASI) or a Feat. This is a critical choice for a Paladin,\"}, {\"text\": \" as it determines whether she focuses on physical prowess (Stre"]
[0.000, "o", "ngth), spiritual resonance (Charisma), or specialized tactical utility (Feats). The\"}, {\"text\": \" Second Chamber trial is currently frozen in a modal state to allow for this decision. I have synchronized her character sheet to reflect her Level\"}, {\"text\": \" 4 stats, including the HP increase to 36.\\\",\\n    \\\"context\\\": \\\"Level 4 Paladin Advancement Review\"}, {\"text\": \"\\\",\\n    \\\"situation_assessment\\\": {\\n      \\\"current_state\\\": \\\"Test Character is Level 4 with 5746 XP.\"}, {\"text\": \" The combat with Construct Beta (24/45 HP) is paused.\\\",\\n      \\\"key_factors\\\": [\\n        \\\"Strength\"}, {\"text\": \" 16 provides +3 to hit/dmg\\\",\\n        \\\"Charisma 14 provides +2 to Sacred Weapon and\"}, {\"text\": \" Save DCs\\\",\\n        \\\"Sentinel and Heavy Armor Master offer distinct defensive/control paths\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"constraints\"}, {\"text\": \"\\\": [\\n        \\\"Time is frozen during review\\\",\\n        \\\"Only one selection can be made at this level\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"resources\"}, {\"text\": \"_available\\\": [\\n        \\\"Ab"]
