[0.000, "o", "-    {\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "-      \"text\": \"Setting: A divine training gauntlet of sparring constructs | Description: Real MCP organic progression test in a divine training gauntlet. The campaign should use normal story actions, real LLM responses, and real planning_block clicks through any level-up modal.\",\r\n"]
