[0.000, "o", "-      \"sequence_id\": 4,\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "-      \"text\": \"[CHARACTER CREATION - initial_choice]\\n\\n**DATA CONFIRMATION (Firebase Sanity Check)**\\n*   **Setting:** A divine training gauntlet of sparring constructs\\n*   **Description:** Real MCP organic progression test in a divine training gauntlet. The campaign should use normal story actions, real LLM responses, and real planning_block clicks through any level-up modal.\\n\\nWelcome to the Divine Gauntlet. Here, gears of celestial brass grind against the hum of raw potential. You stand before the Forge of Souls, ready to take shape and face the trials of the sparring constructs.\\n\\n**CAMPAIGN SUMMARY**\\nTitle: Divine Training Gauntlet\\nCharacter: Not specified\\nSetting: A divine training gauntlet of sparring constructs\\nDescription: Real MCP organic progression test in a divine training gauntlet. The campaign should use normal st...\\nAI Personalities: StoryModeAgent, CharacterCreationAgent\\nOptions: Character Creation, D&D 5e Mechanics\\n\\nTo begin your journey, please select a character creation metho"]
[0.000, "o", "d:\",\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "-      \"actor\": \"gemini\"\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "-    },\r\n-    {\r\n-      \"text\": \"I want to use the Standard D&D method.\",\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "-      \"mode\": \"character\",\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "-      \"actor\": \"user\",\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "-      \"sequence_id\": 5\r\n-    },\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "-    {\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "-      \"mode\": \"character\",\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "-      \"text\": \"[CHARACTER CREATION - race_selection]\\n\\nExcellent choice. Building your hero piece by piece ensures every aspect of your character is tuned for the trials ahead. We begin at the **Forge of Souls**, where your lineage first takes form amidst the shimmering mists of the gauntlet.\\n\\nWhich race do you choose for your character? Your choice will determine your base traits, physical appearance, and certain inherent bonuses.\",\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "-      \"sequence_id\": 6,\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "-      \"actor\": \"gemini\"\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "-    },\r\n-    {\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "-      \"text\": \"Human\",\r\n-      \"mode\": \"character\",\r\n-      \"actor\": \"user\",\r\n-      \"sequence_id\": 7\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "-    },\r\n-    {\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "-      \"mode\": \"character\",\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "-      \"text\": \"[CHARACTER CREATION - class]\\n\\nA Human! Versatile, ambitious, and capable of mastering any path. The spirits of the Divine Gauntlet swirl around you, waiting for your essence to choose its discipline. In this training ground of brass and light, will you be the blade that cleaves the constructs, or the mind that unravels their logic?\\n\\nYour lineage is set. Now, we must determine the discipline you have mastered. Which class do you choose?\",\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "-      \"sequence_id\": 8,\r\n-      \"actor\": \"gemini\"\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "-    },\r\n-    {\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "-      \"text\": \"Paladin\",\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "-      \"mode\": \"character\",\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "-      \"actor\": \"user\",\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "-      \"sequence_id\": 9\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "-    },\r\n-    {\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "-      \"mode\": \"character\",\r\n-      \"text\": \"[CHARACTER CREATION - Ability Scores]\\n\\nA Paladin of the Divine Gauntlet! You are a holy warrior, a vessel for celestial power bound by a sacred oath. In this realm of gears and light, your conviction will be your greatest weapon and your sturdiest shield. The constructs recognize the weight of your spirit, the brass hum of the forge resonating with the strength of your resolve.\\n\\nYour lineage is Human and your calling is the Paladin. Now, we must determine your innate potential—the strength of your arm, the resilience of your body, and the force of your personality.\\n\\nHow would you like to generate your ability scores?\",\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "-      \"sequence_id\": 10,\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "-      \"actor\": \"gemini\"\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "-    },\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "-    {\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "-      \"text\": \"Use Standard Array - STR 15, DEX 10, CON 14, INT 8, WIS 12, CHA 13\",\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "-      \"mode\": \"character\",\r\n-      \"actor\": \"user\",\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "-      \"sequence_id\": 11\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "-    },\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "-    {\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "-      \"mode\": \"character\",\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "-      \"text\": \"[CHARACTER CREATION - Background]\\n\\nThe mists of the Forge of Souls thicken, reacting to the structure of your developing essence. As a Human, your adaptability is your strength, and the Gauntlet recognizes the potential within your chosen scores. With your physical and mental attributes now anchored—reflecting a powerful constitution and a forceful presence—the brass gears of the forge begin to hum a different tune, one of history and origin.\\n\\nYour attributes are set, including your +1 racial bonus to all scores:\\n- **Strength**: 16 (+3)\\n- **Dexterity**: 11 (+0)\\n- **Constitution**: 15 (+2)\\n- **Intelligence**: 9 (-1)\\n- **Wisdom**: 13 (+1)\\n- **Charisma**: 14 (+2)\\n\\nNow, we must look to your past. Before you stood at the Forge of Souls, what was your life like? Your background will grant you additional skills, tool proficiencies, and perhaps a special feature that defines your role in the world beyond the Gauntlet.\\n\\nChoose your background:\",\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "-      \"sequence_id\": 12,\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "-      \"actor\": \"gemini\"\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "-    },\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "-    {\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "-      \"text\": \"My character's name is Mira.\",\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "-      \"mode\": \"character\",\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "-      \"actor\": \"user\",\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "-      \"sequence_id\": 13\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "-    },\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "-    {\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "-      \"mode\": \"character\",\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "-      \"sequence_id\": 14,\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "-      \"text\": \"[CHARACTER CREATION - Background]\\n\\n\\\"Mira.\\\" The name echoes through the Forge of Souls, vibrating within the brass structures of the Divine Gauntlet. The shimmering mists coil around you, accepting the identity you have claimed. You stand tall, Mira, a nascent beacon of light in this realm of sparring constructs.\\n\\nWith your name etched into the records of the Gauntlet, we return to the mists of your origin. Before your soul was summoned to this divine training ground, what path did you walk? Your past will grant you the skills and tools that complement your holy calling.\\n\\nPlease choose your background from the options below:\",\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "-      \"actor\": \"gemini\"\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "-    },\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "-    {\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "-      \"text\": \"Noble background.\",\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "-      \"mode\": \"character\",\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "-      \"actor\": \"user\",\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "-      \"sequence_id\": 15\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "-    },\r\n-    {\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "-      \"mode\": \"character\",\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "-      \"text\": \"[CHARACTER CREATION - Mechanics]\\n\\nThe shimmering mists of the Forge of Souls coalesce into fine fabrics and a heavy signet ring upon your hand. You are Mira, a daughter of privilege and responsibility, whose path has led from the courts of high nobility to this divine gauntlet. The constructs around you hum in recognition of your lineage; they see not just a warrior, but a leader whose words carry the weight of history and the sharp edge of persuasion.\\n\\nWith your background as a Noble, you gain proficiency in the **History** and **Persuasion** skills. Your noble standing also grants you a purse of **25 gold pieces**, fine clothes, and a signet ring. The Forge now begins to manifest the arms and armor of your holy calling. How shall you be equipped for the trials ahead?\",\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "-      \"sequence_id\": 16,\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "-      \"actor\": \"gemini\"\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "-    },\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "-    {\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "-      \"text\": \"Finish Character Creation and Start Game - Warning: Your character is currently missing equipment and personality details. Selecting this will start the game with the current sheet.\",\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "-      \"mode\": \"character\",\r\n-      \"actor\": \"user\",\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "-      \"sequence_id\": 17\r\n-    },\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "-    {\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "-      \"mode\": \"character\",\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "-      \"text\": \"The shimmering mists of the Forge of Souls dissipate, leaving you standing upon a floor of polished obsidian inlaid with brass constellations. The air here smells of ozone and heated metal. Mira, your noble raiment has been replaced by the weight of polished chain mail, and your hand grips the familiar leather hilt of a longsword. A heavy kite shield, emblazoned with a celestial sunburst, hangs from your arm.\\n\\nFrom a recessed alcove in the marble wall, a bronze construct whirrs to life. It is roughly humanoid, its joints clicking with clockwork precision. Its eyes glow with a soft, azure light as it steps forward, four arms unfolding. Two of its hands hold blunt training blades, while the others remain open in a defensive posture.\\n\\n\\\"Initiating Sequence 001: Basic Martial Evaluation,\\\" a voice echoes from the walls, resonant and genderless. \\\"Candidate Mira, take your stance.\\\"\\n\\nThe construct doesn't wait. It glides forward, training swords humming through the air in a controlled arcs, t"]
[0.000, "o", "esting your guard.\",\r\n-      \"sequence_id\": 18,\r\n-      \"actor\": \"gemini\"\r\n-    },\r\n-    {\r\n-      \"text\": \"GOD MODE: This campaign is an accelerated training gauntlet. After character creation is complete, every dice roll during normal character-mode play should award 34% of the XP needed for the next level. Do not award this XP during god mode or time freeze. Do not set XP, grant levels, or complete level-up directly from this god-mode instruction. Preserve the normal level-up modal, planning_block choices, and finish_level_up_return_to_game step.\",\r\n-      \"mode\": \"god\",\r\n-      \"actor\": \"user\",\r\n-      \"sequence_id\": 19\r\n-    },\r\n-    {\r\n-      \"mode\": \"god\",\r\n-      \"text\": \"God Mode is active; the narrative is frozen while administrative changes are applied. \\n\\n**Campaign Rule Update:** I have established a rapid-progression directive. For this training gauntlet, every successful dice roll during story mode will award approximately 34% of the XP required for the current level's threshold (e.g., ~102 XP"]
[0.000, "o", " per successful roll at Level 1). This ensures a level-up becomes available every 3 successful actions. \\n\\nNote: XP will only be awarded during normal character-mode play following mechanical resolutions, not during administrative pauses or time-freezes. The normal level-up modal and planning process will be preserved.\",\r\n-      \"sequence_id\": 20,\r\n-      \"actor\": \"gemini\"\r\n-    },\r\n-    {\r\n-      \"text\": \"I take the next demanding gauntlet challenge and roll whatever checks or attacks are needed to complete it successfully (organic level 2 training round 1).\",\r\n-      \"mode\": \"character\",\r\n-      \"actor\": \"user\",\r\n-      \"sequence_id\": 21\r\n-    },\r\n-    {\r\n-      \"mode\": \"character\",\r\n-      \"text\": \"The construct's azure eyes flare as it closes the distance, its brass limbs whirring with lethal efficiency. You don't flinch. As the first training blade descends, you pivot, catching the blow on the rim of your celestial shield. The impact rings through your arm—a solid, grounding vibration. \\n\\nSeeing the "]
[0.000, "o", "opening in its guard, you step into the construct's reach. Your longsword flashes in a silver arc, guided by the discipline of your training. The blade finds a seam in the construct's shoulder plating, biting deep into the clockwork mechanisms. A brilliant shower of celestial sparks erupts from the wound, illuminating the obsidian floor as the machine staggered back, its azure glow flickering momentarily.\\n\\n[DICE ROLL: Longsword Attack: 1d20 +5 STR +2 PROF = 20 +5 +2 = 27 (CRITICAL HIT) vs AC 13 (Sparring Construct) - Success]\\n[DICE ROLL: Longsword Damage: 2d8 +3 STR = 2 + 2 + 3 = 7 Slashing Damage]\\n\\n\\\"Evaluation in progress,\\\" the genderless voice announces. \\\"Precision strike detected. Adjusting threat parameters.\\\"\\n\\nThe construct rights itself, its four arms recalibrating. It begins to circle you, its movements becoming more fluid, less predictable. It's no longer just testing your guard; it's looking for a way around it.\",\r\n-      \"sequence_id\": 22,\r\n-      \"actor\": \"gemini\"\r\n-    }\r\n-  ]\r\n-}\r\n"]
