[0.000, "o", "oots.\\n\\n\\\"Synchronization incomplete,\\\" the genderless voice of the Gauntlet resonates from the very air around you. \\\"Candidate Mira, your soul's essence has expanded, but it remains unanchored. The path to Sequence 002 is locked behind Tier 2 harmonization. You must commit your new discipline to the Forge before the trials can proceed.\\\"\\n\\nThe mists of the Forge of Souls swirl more aggressively now, presenting the same spectral choices you saw before—the divine blueprints for your evolution as a Paladin.\",\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "-  \"planning_block\": {\r\n-    \"thinking\": \"The player is attempting to bypass the level-up modal, but the Gauntlet's internal logic—and the strict campaign rules for this progression test—require the synchronization to be completed. I will maintain the level-up state and represent the choices as mandatory parameters for the next trial phase.\",\r\n-    \"context\": \"Level-up modal synchronization in progress.\",\r\n-    \"choices\": [\r\n-      {\r\n-        \"id\": \"level_up_hp_fixed\",\r\n-        \"text\": \"Increase HP (Fixed)\",\r\n-        \"description\": \"Increase maximum HP by 8 (6 + Constitution modifier). New Max HP: 20.\",\r\n-        \"risk_level\": \"safe\",\r\n-        \"freeze_time\": true\r\n-      },\r\n-      {\r\n-        \"id\": \"level_up_fighting_style_defense\",\r\n"]
